      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuel said to Saul, “Why have you disturbed me? Why did you make me come back?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul answered, “I am in great trouble! The Philistines are at war with me, and God has abandoned me. He doesn't answer me any more, either by prophets or by dreams. And so I have called you, for you to tell me what I must do.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuel said, “Why do you call me when the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has abandoned you and become your enemy? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has done to you what he told you through me: he has taken the kingdom away from you and given it to David instead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.3+1SA.15.4+1SA.15.5+1SA.15.6+1SA.15.7+1SA.15.8+1SA.15.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15.3–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You disobeyed the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s command and did not completely destroy the Amalekites and all they had. That is why the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is doing this to you now. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will hand you and Israel over to the Philistines. Tomorrow you and your sons will join me, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will also hand the army of Israel over to the Philistines.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At once Saul fell down and lay stretched out on the ground, terrified by what Samuel had said. He was weak, because he had not eaten anything all day and all night. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The woman went over to him and saw that he was terrified, so she said to him, “Please, sir, I risked my life by doing what you asked. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now please do what I ask. Let me prepare some food for you. You must eat so that you will be strong enough to travel.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul refused and said he would not eat anything. But his officers also urged him to eat. He finally gave in, got up from the ground, and sat on the bed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The woman quickly killed a calf which she had been fattening. Then she took some flour, prepared it, and baked some bread without yeast. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She set the food before Saul and his officers, and they ate it. And they left that same night.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
